  <running_head>DOCTR. CHRIST. 3. PARS</running_head>
  <bottom_margin>
    <catchword>Qua</catchword>
  </bottom_margin>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" para="true">cæptis &amp; castigationibus ea, qua par est, obe-</l>
    <l n="2">dientia submittamus{a}: Tum etiam ut eorum vi-</l>
    <l n="3">tia &amp; mores nostra patientia toleremus{b}, illud</l>
    <l n="4">semper cogitantes : Deum nos illorum manu</l>
    <l n="5">velle ducere ac regere{</l>
    <l n="6">c}.</l>
    <l n="7" type="heading" level="3" para="true">
      <i>Quid flagitat Deus in sexto præcepto?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="8" para="true">Ut proximum neque cogitatione, neque</l>
    <l n="9">gestibus, nedum factis, vel per me, vel per ali-</l>
    <l n="10">um, contumelia afficiam, aut oderim, aut lædam, aut occidam{d}: sed omnem vindictæ cu-</l>
    <l n="11">piditatem abiiciam{e}. Adhæc ne meipsum læ-</l>
    <l n="12">dam, aut sciens in aliquod periculum coniici-</l>
    <l n="13">am{f}. Quocirca etiam ne cædes fierent, Magi-</l>
    <l n="14">stratum gladio armauit{g}.</l>
    <l n="15" para="true">
      <i>Atqui hoc præceptum solam cædam prohibere videtur.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16" para="true">At cædem prohibendo, docet Deus fera-</l>
    <l n="17">dicem &amp; originem cædis, iram scilicet{h}, invi-</l>
    <l n="18">diam{i}, odium &amp; vindictæ cupiditatem odisse,</l>
    <l n="19">atque ea omnia pro cæde ducere{k}.</l>
    <l n="20" para="true">
      <i>An vero id satis est nos neminem eo, quo dictum</i>
    </l>
    <l n="21">
      <i>est modo, occidere?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="22" para="true">Non est satis: dum enim Deus iram, invidi-</l>
    <l n="23">am, odium damnat, postulat ut proximum</l>
    <l n="24">æque ac nos ipsos diligamus{m}, &amp; ut humanita-</l>
    <l n="25">te{n}, lenitate, mansuetudine, patientia,{o} &amp; mise-</l>
    <l n="26">ricordia{p}, erga eum utamur, quòdq; ei damno</l>
    <l n="27">esse possit, quantum in nobis est, auertamus{q}:</l>
    <l n="28">Ad summam, ita animo affecti simus, ut ne</l>
    <l n="29">inimicis quidem benefacere dubitemus{r}.</l>
    <l n="30" type="foot" para="true">Mat.5.44.45. Ro.12. 20.21.</l>
  </main_text>
